---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Svelte · alert-notify docs"
  description="Use alert-notify in Svelte 5 with the optional Toaster component."
  pageTitle="Svelte"
>
  <p>
    <span class="tier helper">Helper</span>
    Svelte ships <code>Toaster.svelte</code> only. There is no Svelte <code>custom()</code> helper.
  </p>

  <pre class="api"><code>{`<script>
  import { toast } from "alert-notify";
  import Toaster from "alert-notify/svelte";
</script>

<Toaster position="top-right" richColors />
<button onclick={() => toast.success("Saved")}>Save</button>`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Custom DOM content</h2>
  <pre class="api"><code>{`import { toast } from "alert-notify";
const el = document.createElement("div");
el.textContent = "Custom";
toast.custom(el);`}</code></pre>

  <ul class="notes">
    <li>Peer dependency: svelte &gt;= 5.</li>
    <li>Landing page: <a href="/svelte">/svelte</a></li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
